 "title": "FRP series high power thick film chip resistors, 0402 to 2512",
 "source": {
  "document": "FJ-JS-3001",
  "revision": "V1.0/2025.01.01",
  "pages": 13
 },
 "summary": "FRP is a high power thick film chip resistor family, rated from 1/10 W in 0402 to 2 W in 2512 at 70 °C. Values span 1 Ω to 10 MΩ at ±0.05% to ±5%, with a zero-ohm jumper in each size; TCR is ±100 ppm/°C from 10 Ω up and ±400 ppm/°C below. The parts are RoHS compliant and halogen free, for uses such as switching supplies, over-current protection in audio equipment, VRMs, DC-DC converters, chargers, engine control and portable devices.",
 "key_figures": [
